; Crosses collected (0-12)
;
; Incremented by #R$A782 and #R$A777 when a cross is picked up. The status bar draws that many crosses (#R$9C1B). With
; 12 (CROSSES_NEEDED) the chalice appears in room 24 (#R$A734) and the ring of crosses is shown (#R$AE4B). Zeroed at
; the start of a game.
@label=Crosses
g$854D DEFB $00
